怒りの日 聖なるインターネットに 血の雨が降り注いだ日 愚かなロリコンを骨の髄まで 浄化する 一筋の光 それが ういビームなのである ういは 全てを赦します
Day of wrath. The day blood rained upon the holy internet. A single ray of light purifying foolish lolicons to the bone marrow. That is the Ui Beam. Ui forgives everything.

92
00:17:44,874 --> 00:17:56,774
嗚呼 この世の醜さを 集めて描いてみるよ 真っ白なキャンバスが 穢れて泣いている
Ah, I'll gather and depict the ugliness of this world. A pure white canvas is defiled and crying.

93
00:17:57,774 --> 00:18:01,274
Lonely 振り向いた少女は そっと手を掴む
Lonely, the turning girl gently grabs your hand.

94
00:18:04,874 --> 00:18:10,174
楽園など無いから
Because there is no paradise

95
00:18:11,174 --> 00:18:17,474
おっきなお友達のみんなえ お前らが打ち込んでいる虚無には 何の意味があるの？
To all the big kids out there, what meaning is there in the void you are pouring yourselves into?

96
00:18:17,874 --> 00:18:23,874
ねぇ 教えてよ こよ ぜんぜぇーんわかんないんだ！
Hey, tell me. Koyo doesn't understand at all!

97
00:18:25,174 --> 00:18:30,174
ロリロリ神 降臨（ずっきゅーん！） さよなら笑顔でバイバイ（ばっきゅーん！）
Loli-Loli God descended (Zukyuun!) Saying goodbye with a smile, bye-bye (Bakyuun!)

98
00:18:30,574 --> 00:18:36,174
ピリオドをどうぞ この手で押してあげゆ
Please take your period, I'll press it for you with this hand.

99
00:18:36,574 --> 00:18:41,574
Lovely ロリロリ神 降臨（ずっきゅーん！） 鐘を鳴らせばこの通り（Yes!）
Lovely Loli-Loli God descended (Zukyuun!) Ring the bell and this is how it turns out (Yes!)

100
00:18:42,174 --> 00:18:47,374
とっても優しくて 素敵なお兄ちゃん
A very gentle and wonderful big brother!

101
00:18:47,874 --> 00:18:53,674
楽園でホラ ねんねしな
Come on, go to sleep in paradise.

102
00:18:54,174 --> 00:18:57,574
それが救済の
That is the salvation of...

103
00:18:58,174 --> 00:19:02,374
レクイエム
...Requiem

104
00:19:04,174 --> 00:19:08,524
せーのっ～ 触ったら逮捕！（Ah!） 極Chu de 点呼！（Uh!） いち にー さん しー？
Ready, go! Touch me and you're arrested! (Ah!) Extreme Chu roll call! (Uh!) One, two, three, four?

105
00:19:09,024 --> 00:19:12,824
(ごめんなさーい！) ハァ？ ごめんなさいが 聞こえなーい（え～？！）
(I'm so sorry!) Ha? I can't hear your "I'm so sorry!" (Eh?!)

106
00:19:13,524 --> 00:19:16,224
粛聖!! ロリ神レクイエム☆
Purge!! Loli-God Requiem☆

107
00:19:17,174 --> 00:19:22,524
ほんっとーに きもちわるい
So ve-rynyu, creepy...

108
00:19:26,524 --> 00:19:30,124
ういちゃん！
Ui-chan!

109
00:19:30,324 --> 00:19:35,224
え、こわい。誰？ あ、こよりお姉ちゃんだよ！
Eh, scary. Who? Ah, it's big sister Koyori!

110
00:19:35,324 --> 00:19:37,524
お疲れ様！
Good job!

111
00:19:37,624 --> 00:19:47,524
いやあ、ういビーム出る？ 出ないです、さようなら。 あ, ちょっと待ってちょっと待って、待ってくださーい！ 蔑んだ目で見てもらえる？
Man, does the Ui Beam come out? It doesn't, goodbye. Ah, wait a minute, please wait! Can you look at me with contemptuous eyes?

112
00:19:48,024 --> 00:19:54,024
やばい信者だ… ういちゃーん！この後お姉ちゃんちに行ってほしいの！
What a dangerous believer... Ui-chan! I want you to come over to my house afterwards!

113
00:19:54,524 --> 00:20:00,024
え、お誕生日プレゼントにういちゃんもらえるんじゃない…？
Eh, can I get Ui-chan as a birthday present...?

114
00:20:00,554 --> 00:20:02,714
もうお家に帰っていいんじゃないの！？
Wait, isn't it fine to just go home!?

115
00:20:06,344 --> 00:20:06,944
うわ！
Whoa!

116
00:20:07,154 --> 00:20:08,514
しぐれ先生、何してんの？
Shigure-sensei, what are you doing?

117
00:20:08,804 --> 00:20:09,944
あれ？さっきまでロリじゃなかったですか？
Huh? Weren't you a loli just a second ago?

118
00:20:09,994 --> 00:20:13,594
いや、ううん、いや、私か、あれ今、今連れて来られちゃったんですか？可愛い
No, um, no, I... Wait, did you just bring me here right now? So cute!

119
00:20:14,374 --> 00:20:16,914
え、誰々？知らん、知らない、誰？あれ、おかしいでしょ！
Eh, who? I don't know, I don't know, who is... That's weird!

120
00:20:16,914 --> 00:20:18,694
え、誰？
Eh, who?!

121
00:20:18,694 --> 00:20:22,414
あなたの幼少期でしょ！
Your childhood, duh!

122
00:20:23,034 --> 00:20:25,594
え、ていうか何？何その姿は？
Eh, wait, what? What's with that look?

123
00:20:25,784 --> 00:20:29,844
ロリ神、やったじゃないですか！
Loli God, we did it!

124
00:20:30,464 --> 00:20:34,524
え、恥ずかしいよ！え、だ、だ、だって、そんなの自分だってつけてたじゃん！
Eh, it's embarrassing! E-D-Data, you were wearing it too, weren't you?!

125
00:20:36,464 --> 00:20:37,484
外してこ。
I'll take it off.

126
00:20:37,924 --> 00:20:39,224
あ、はい、はい。
Ah, yes, yes.

127
00:20:39,414 --> 00:20:41,594
あれ、記憶これ共有されないタイプなのか？
Huh? Is this memory not shared between us?

128
00:20:42,014 --> 00:20:44,234
え、何何言ってんだろ？え、あ、1人になっちゃった。
Eh, what is she even talking about? Eh, ah, I'm all by myself.

129
00:20:44,434 --> 00:20:46,394
みなさーん！こんにちはー！
Everyone! Hello!

130
00:20:47,024 --> 00:20:53,144
私が乗っ取ったよ！乗っ取った！いよいよ乗ってきましたよー！
I've taken over! Taken over! We're finally rolling!

131
00:20:53,974 --> 00:20:57,734
いや、こよちゃんもさ、しぐれういの見てたから忘れちゃっててけど？
Man, Koyori-chan, since you were watching Shigure Ui's, you forgot, right?

132
00:20:58,294 --> 00:20:59,374
あ、誕生日おめでとう！
Ah, happy birthday!

133
00:20:59,464 --> 00:21:03,984
あ、やったー！ありがとうございます！おめでとうす！誕生日ガールです！
Ah, yay! Thank you so much! Congrats! I'm the birthday girl!

134
00:21:03,984 --> 00:21:07,004
誕生日ガール、大体1人ずつ喋っ
Birthday girl, usually one person talks at a...

135
00:21:07,164 --> 00:21:08,604
いやいや、多すぎる！
No way, too many!

136
00:21:08,604 --> 00:21:09,964
1人じゃないよ！いたんだよ、さっきまでロリういちゃんが！
I'm not alone! Loli Ui-chan was right here until a second ago!

137
00:21:10,774 --> 00:21:11,914
幻みたいな。
Like an illusion.

138
00:21:13,234 --> 00:21:17,414
ロリういちゃんはいるんだ！いたもん！
Loli Ui-chan IS here! She was here!

139
00:21:17,834 --> 00:21:19,494
じゃあなんかしてたの？さっき2人で。
So what were you guys doing just now, the two of you?

140
00:21:19,924 --> 00:21:27,304
あ、そうなんです。よしさんが作ったね、みみみねういーんを一緒に歌って踊っていたわけですよ。
Ah, that's right. We were singing and dancing together to 'Mimimi Neuin', which Yoshi-san made.

141
00:21:27,304 --> 00:21:29,924
そうなんだ。私とは何もしてくれないってわけ？え？え？
Is that so? So you're not going to do anything with me? Eh? Eh?

142
00:21:30,344 --> 00:21:34,224
え、え？嘘、うそ、したけど、え、してない、してない、してない、まだ何もししてない、まだ！
Eh, eh? No, no, I did, wait, I didn't, I haven't done anything yet!

143
00:21:35,374 --> 00:21:39,954
でもでもでもでもでも！それは歌って踊ってくれるってこと？もちろん、何のために来たと思ってんの！
But, but, but, but, but! Does that mean you'll sing and dance with me? Of course! What do you think I came here for?!

144
00:21:39,954 --> 00:21:44,774
えー！やったー！もう1曲やってくれるんだ！嬉しい！
Eeeh! Yay! You're gonna do one more song with me?! I'm so happy!

145
00:21:44,944 --> 00:21:46,424
1曲、いやまだ1曲しか
One song... well, we only did one song so far.

146
00:21:46,424 --> 00:21:48,404
いや、贅沢だな！いや贅沢だな！
Man, you're greedy! So greedy!

147
00:21:49,034 --> 00:21:53,414
え、つ、つ、じゃあなんですけど、あのこの前ね、こよちゃんが聞きそびれてしまった突発凸待ちの時に
Eh, back then, um, the other day when Yui missed the stream...

148
00:21:53,514 --> 00:21:58,294
なんかこよちゃんの新曲結構聞いててって、お話ししてくれてたじゃないですか！
...you were saying how you listened to Koyori-chan's new song a lot!

149
00:21:58,294 --> 00:22:03,294
おかし、オタクの配信見ないで！アーカイブも全部見たわ！最初から最後まで見たから！
Wait, don't watch otaku streams! I watched all the archives! I watched from start to finish!

150
00:22:03,654 --> 00:22:08,854
やった！じゃあ、あの曲、あの曲をお願いしてもいいですか？
Yay! Then, can I ask for that song, that song?

151
00:22:09,164 --> 00:22:14,394
もちろんですよ！もう、やる気満々じゃないの！
Of course! You're super motivated, aren't you!

152
00:22:14,514 --> 00:22:17,932
いや、練習しましたから！一緒にやったもんね、ですね！
Well, I practiced! We did it together, right!

153
00:22:18,032 --> 00:22:26,572
ということでね、こちらもまもなくお届けする楽曲、シアワセ√コヨリニウムも一緒に歌って踊っちゃいまーす！いえーい！
And so, we'll also sing and dance together to the song we'll be heading out to soon, 'Siawase √ Koyorinium'! Yay!

154
00:22:39,412 --> 00:22:44,552
コヨチャン チュキ コヨチャン チュキチュキ（えへへ えへへへ）
Koyo-chan chuki, Koyo-chan chuki chuki (Ehehe ehehehe)

155
00:22:45,052 --> 00:22:50,072
みんなの脳みそにお注射しちゃうぞー！
Giving you a brain injection!

156
00:22:50,872 --> 00:23:02,352
実験だ！実験だ！ 実験！実験！実験だ！ 実験だ！実験だ！ うぉー わっふー！
Experiment! Experiment! Experiment, experiment, experiment! Experiment! Experiment! Woo, wahoo!

157
00:23:03,232 --> 00:23:08,552
研究 研究 研究 耐久回 急上昇中 呼ばれて飛び出て バビブベボ boom!
Research, research, research, rapid rise! Called out, jumping out, babibubebo boom!

158
00:23:08,952 --> 00:23:14,552
検証 検証 検証 caution アテンションプリーズ 舐めてたら火傷しちゃうョ
Verification, verification, verification, CAUTION attention please! If you underestimate it, you'll get burned.

159
00:23:15,172 --> 00:23:20,952
迷ったらダメダメ 真夜中サイエンス 魔除けの呪文は マヨマヨちゅっちゅ！
If you're lost, no no, midnight science! The exorcism spell is Mayomayo chuchu!

160
00:23:21,052 --> 00:23:26,572
今宵のデザート 高揚する heartbeat こよりこよられ 恋焦がれ（わっふー！）
Tonight's dessert, a soaring heartbeat, Koyori and Koyorare, yearning for love (wahoo!)

161
00:23:26,992 --> 00:23:32,432
サイン コサイン タンジェント (ay) 試験管 docking ダイレクト (ay) 白衣の天使が降臨！（やっほー！）
Sine, cosine, tangent (ay)! Test tube docking direct (ay)! The angel in a white coat descends! (Yahoo!)

162
00:23:32,872 --> 00:23:35,892
天才天才天才 とんでもなく偉い
Genius, genius, genius! Inordinately great!

163
00:23:36,032 --> 00:23:41,552
崇めちゃって OK 褒めてくスタイル 最高最高最高 そんでラブって優勝
Worshiping is OK, praise-heavy style! The best, the best, the best! And love to win!

164
00:23:41,912 --> 00:23:46,452
ぶっちゃけ 脳内シュワシュワ スタンディングオベーション
To be honest, fizzing in the brain, standing ovation!

165
00:23:46,772 --> 00:23:50,432
科学とは 爆発だ
What is science? It's an explosion!

166
00:23:51,072 --> 00:23:57,372
ポチッとピポパ 間違えてドッカーン ドジなトコも 計算通りよ (let's go!)
Press pipopa, mistake and dokkaan! Even my clumsy side is all according to plan (let's go!)

167
00:23:57,932 --> 00:24:10,532
実験だ！実験だ！ 実験！実験！実験だ！ 実験だ！実験だ！ うぉー わっふー！ 実験だ！実験だ！ 実験！実験！実験だ！ 実験だ！実験だ！ 実・験・だ！
Experiment! Experiment! Experiment, experiment, experiment! Experiment! Experiment! Woo, wahoo! Experiment! Experiment! Experiment, experiment, experiment! Experiment! Experiment! Ex-per-i-ment!

168
00:24:11,032 --> 00:24:21,932
「さぁて 早速始めましょう！これより行うは天才マッドサイエンティストと天才イラストレーターによる世にも奇妙な、すん～ばらしい大～実験ッ！」
Now then, let's get started right away! The bizarre, marvelous grand experiment conducted from now on by a genius mad scientist and a genius illustrator!

169
00:24:22,272 --> 00:24:27,792
ようこそ魅惑のラボラトリー（ドキドキワクワク胸打つ鼓動）
Welcome to the enchanting laboratory! (Throbbing, thrilling, heartbeat pounding)

170
00:24:28,032 --> 00:24:33,932
怖くない大丈夫よ（ホラケタケタカラカラ 笑いましょう）
It's not scary, it's okay (Come on, laughing keketa karakara)

171
00:24:34,172 --> 00:24:39,952
試験管をブッ刺せば完了（ドクドクバクバク脈打つ波動）
Sticking the test tube in is complete (Throbbing, pounding, pulsating waves)

172
00:24:40,192 --> 00:24:46,212
[Text: 原子番号315番、コヨリニウム] これは、シアワセになる最高の粒子だよ！
[Text: Atomic Number 315, Koyorinium] This is the ultimate particle that brings happiness!

173
00:24:46,472 --> 00:24:52,032
病みつきになっちゃえばEじゃん！欲しいなら叫べばEじゃん！
It's great if you get hooked! It's great if you shout if you want it!

174
00:24:52,152 --> 00:24:58,032
大好きですかー？（大好きでーす！）シアワセですかー？（シアワセでーす！）
Do you love it?! (We love it!) Are you happy?! (We're happy!)

175
00:24:58,232 --> 00:25:00,040
愛すれば救われる 嗚呼 なんて素敵な世界なんでしょう！
If you love, you'll be saved. Ah, what a wonderful world it is!

176
00:25:00,362 --> 00:25:00,902
愛すれば救われる
Loving will save you.

177
00:25:01,102 --> 00:25:02,302
嗚呼 なんて素敵な世界なんでしょう！
Ah, what a wonderful world!

178
00:25:02,362 --> 00:25:02,942
「ほんまか？」
"Really?"

179
00:25:02,942 --> 00:25:05,942
一途なその瞳で
With those devoted eyes,

180
00:25:05,942 --> 00:25:06,702
見つめて
gaze at me,

181
00:25:06,702 --> 00:25:07,452
推して
support me,

182
00:25:07,452 --> 00:25:08,612
萌えて
adore me,

183
00:25:08,612 --> 00:25:10,062
溶けちゃえ
and melt away.

184
00:25:10,062 --> 00:25:10,782
明るい
To a bright

185
00:25:10,782 --> 00:25:13,332
未来に
future,

186
00:25:13,332 --> 00:25:14,112
乾杯
cheers!

187
00:25:14,112 --> 00:25:15,582
明るい未来に 乾杯
Cheers to a bright future!

188
00:25:15,582 --> 00:25:17,412
明るい未来に 乾杯！
Cheers to a bright future!

189
00:26:18,046 --> 00:26:21,046
[Title: ねこねこ☆コネクション] 作詞:ナナホシ管弦楽団 作曲:岩見 陸
[Title: ねこねこ☆コネクション] Lyrics/Music: Nanahoshi Orchestra / Iwami Riku

190
00:26:28,223 --> 00:26:33,353
ねえねえ私 気づいてる 見えるように 消しゴム落としたり
Hey hey, I've noticed! Like dropping my eraser so you'd see...

191
00:26:33,353 --> 00:26:36,823
教科書だって 実は忘れてない バレて焦ってる君は猫みたい
And I actually didn't forget my textbook either! You panicking like you got caught is just like a cat.

192
00:26:39,993 --> 00:26:42,543
全然勉強してねーわ あんなん俺でも出来ちゃうわ
I didn't study at all! Even I could do that.

193
00:26:42,543 --> 00:26:45,413
男子ってば単純ね 愛想笑いでハイハイね
Boys are so simple. Fake smiles, yeah yeah.

194
00:26:45,413 --> 00:26:48,353
変な髪型それ言うな いちいち虫とか見せんでいい！
Don't comment on my hair! You don't need to show me bugs!

195
00:26:48,353 --> 00:26:51,003
そうやって気を引くの なんとかかんないの
Doing stuff like that to get my attention, can't you do something else?

196
00:26:51,393 --> 00:26:56,333
もう遊ぶ気分じゃなくなっちゃうかもダーリン
I might not even be in the mood to play anymore, darling.

197
00:26:56,853 --> 00:27:01,413
かっこつけさせてあげるからキメてよね
Let you look cool so you can support me, so make sure you nail it!

198
00:27:02,173 --> 00:27:07,493
にゃっ！コネコミュニケーション 噛みついちゃう予感合図だぞ見逃せない
Meow! Neko-Communication. A hunch we might bite—that's the signal, don't miss it!

199
00:27:07,763 --> 00:27:13,293
にゃっ！コネコミュニケーション からかうだけじゃわかんない！聞かせてよ
Meow! Neko-Communication. Just teasing isn't enough, I don't get it! Let me hear it.

200
00:27:13,413 --> 00:27:16,853
にゃっ！飛び込んじゃお 爪立てちゃお
Meow! Let's dive right in, let's show our claws.

201
00:27:16,853 --> 00:27:19,903
時々は撫でられたい？
Do you want to be petted sometimes?

202
00:27:20,143 --> 00:27:25,513
きっと手のひらいっぱい愛で気まぐれを仕留めて！
Capture my whims with a palm full of love!

203
00:27:26,083 --> 00:27:27,573
ミャオ！ミャオ！
Meow! Meow!

204
00:27:33,033 --> 00:27:35,923
興味ないって言いながらこっち見てる
Saying "not interested" while looking this way.

205
00:27:35,923 --> 00:27:38,683
聞こえるように好きな子の話してる
Talking about the girl you like so she can hear.

206
00:27:38,683 --> 00:27:41,553
他の子と仲良しで照れ隠し
Hiding your shyness by being friendly with others.

207
00:27:41,553 --> 00:27:44,313
聞き耳立てちゃうねバカみたい
Eavesdropping on you, I look like such a fool.

208
00:27:44,793 --> 00:27:47,423
秘密とかいらねーわ 本気でやったら勝てたわ
I don't need secret tactics! If I tried for real, I'd win!

209
00:27:47,813 --> 00:27:50,353
そーなんだすっごいね じゃあ最初からやっとけば？
Oh really, that's amazing. Then why didn't you do that from the start?

210
00:27:50,353 --> 00:27:53,093
おいっ！お前が好きだって絶対誰にも言うなっ！
Hey! Don't you ever tell anyone that I like you!

211
00:27:53,093 --> 00:27:55,653
そーなんだ気になっちゃう付き合っちゃおうかな
Oh really? Now I'm curious, maybe we should go out.

212
00:27:56,283 --> 00:28:00,903
ねえ顔を破った君も素敵よダーリン
Hey, even with that awkward expression, you're wonderful, darling.

213
00:28:01,393 --> 00:28:05,783
ため息だって駆け引きね数えてて
Even sighs are part of the game, keep counting them.

214
00:28:07,173 --> 00:28:12,433
にゃっ！コネコミュニケーション ためらっちゃうボタン本気だぞ強がりたい
Meow! Neko-Communication. Hesitation button—I'm serious, I want to act tough!

215
00:28:12,913 --> 00:28:18,193
にゃっ！コネコミュニケーション じゃれ合うたびにわかんない！教えてよ
Meow! Neko-Communication. Every time we playfully scuffle, I don't get it! Teach me.

216
00:28:18,463 --> 00:28:21,883
にゃっ！落ち込んじゃお 背伸びしちゃお
Meow! Let's get down, let's stretch ourselves out.

217
00:28:22,063 --> 00:28:25,303
よしよし甘えられない
There there, I can't let myself act spoiled.

218
00:28:25,423 --> 00:28:30,333
嫉妬猫舌言っちゃいたいね熱いのは苦手よ！
I want to say I'm a jealous cat-tongue! I'm bad with hot things!

219
00:28:30,723 --> 00:28:32,453
ミャオ！ミャオ！
Meow! Meow!

220
00:28:44,263 --> 00:28:48,903
もう！なんでもないわ聞き飽きちゃったよダーリン
Geez! It's nothing, I'm already tired of hearing it, darling.

221
00:28:49,273 --> 00:28:54,163
目配せなんてとっておきも君にだけ
Saving even my winks just for you.

222
00:28:55,213 --> 00:29:00,693
にゃっ！コネコミュニケーション 噛みついちゃう予感合図だぞ見逃せない
Meow! Neko-Communication. A hunch we might bite—that's the signal, don't miss it!

223
00:29:00,843 --> 00:29:06,433
にゃっ！コネコミュニケーション からかうだけじゃわかんない！聞かせてよ
Meow! Neko-Communication. Just teasing isn't enough, I don't get it! Let me hear it.

224
00:29:06,793 --> 00:29:10,233
にゃっ！飛び込んじゃお 爪立てちゃお
Meow! Let's dive right in, let's show our claws.

225
00:29:10,393 --> 00:29:13,233
ドキドキ離れられない？
Throbbing heartbeat, can't we break away?

226
00:29:13,473 --> 00:29:15,943
尻尾振るように頂戴愛
Give me love like wagging a tail!

227
00:29:16,333 --> 00:29:19,093
そっけ向きがち曖昧じゃ
Acting aloof and being ambiguous

228
00:29:19,303 --> 00:29:24,503
やっぱ君にはもったいないね気が向けばあげるわ！
Is still too good for you! If I feel like it, I'll give it to you!

229
00:29:25,143 --> 00:29:26,583
チャオ☆ チャオ☆
Ciao☆ Ciao☆

230
00:29:45,380 --> 00:29:46,440
ピィまるだー！
It's P-maru!

231
00:29:47,420 --> 00:29:50,040
お誕生日おめでとう！
Happy birthday!

232
00:29:50,040 --> 00:29:53,040
やったーーー！ありがとう！
Yayyy! Thank you!

233
00:29:53,040 --> 00:30:00,088
お誕生日おめでとう！ありがとう！
Happy birthday! Thank you!

234
00:30:00,370 --> 00:30:01,810
お待たせしましたー！
Sorry to keep you waiting!

235
00:30:01,810 --> 00:30:02,630
よかったー！
Yay!

236
00:30:02,630 --> 00:30:04,650
よかったねー！
So glad!

237
00:30:04,790 --> 00:30:10,560
ということで元気にとび出していただきました、去年の5月にコラボしたP丸様ことPちゃんでーす！
And so, we had Pmaru-sama—aka P-chan, who collaborated with me last May—jump out here with so much energy!

238
00:30:10,560 --> 00:30:14,380
イェーイ！お焚き火こ！
Yay! Let's burn some wood!

239
00:30:14,560 --> 00:30:19,540
お焚き火こ？ということでね、今歌っていただいたのはPちゃんの新曲……
Burn some wood? And so, what we just sang was P-chan's new song—

240
00:30:19,840 --> 00:30:23,820
じゃなくて、Pちゃんの新曲……じゃなくて、あれ？Pちゃんの新曲？
No, P-chan's new song—no, wait? Is it P-chan's new song?

241
00:30:23,820 --> 00:30:27,020
ちがう！七転びカンガルーダンスなんだよ！
No! It's the Nanakorobi Kangaroo Dance!

242
00:30:27,020 --> 00:30:34,950
そうなんです！それを一緒に歌っていただいたんですけど、いやあ、この感じでね、ちょっとテンション高く始めたんですけど、
That's right! We sang that together, and man, we started off with such high tension,

243
00:30:34,950 --> 00:30:39,150
実はですね、こより、なり笑ってんで、
but actually, Koyori has been cracking up laughing—

244
00:30:39,150 --> 00:30:46,520
実はあの、Pちゃんに言いたいことが1つあるんです。はい。なんだろう。え？
Actually, there's one thing I want to tell P-chan. Yes. What is it? Huh?

245
00:30:46,660 --> 00:30:52,420
あの、前にね、Pちゃんが誓いは……Pちゃんがね、去年の末ぐらいに、
Um, earlier, P-chan made a vow... around the end of last year, P-chan said—

246
00:30:52,600 --> 00:30:57,220
今年残業したことっていうのを配信で喋ってたんですよ。あ、へえー。そう、その時に、
on stream about wanting to do overtime this year. Ah, really? Yeah, and at that time,

247
00:30:59,670 --> 00:31:08,360
こよりちゃんのことを猫だと思ってたんだけど、ごめんなさい！キツネだったんだね！って言ってて、え、知ってたんですよ！
she said, "I thought Koyori-chan was a cat, but I'm sorry! She was a fox!" And I was like, "I've been saying that all along!"

248
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:10,640
え、待って、キツネじゃないの？
Wait, aren't you a fox?

249
00:31:10,840 --> 00:31:12,380
コヨーテだよ！
I'm a coyote!

250
00:31:12,480 --> 00:31:14,380
コヨーテって何？コヨーテってキツネの妖怪じゃないの？
What's a coyote? Isn't a coyote a kind of fox spirit?

251
00:31:14,660 --> 00:31:18,940
え？コヨーテってキツネの妖怪？いや、キツネの妖怪は妖狐やろ！
Eh? A coyote is a fox spirit? No, a fox spirit is a youko!

252
00:31:19,060 --> 00:31:21,060
ああー！
Ahhh!

253
00:31:21,060 --> 00:31:23,280
えー、すごーい！コヨーテじゃなくて、妖怪じゃなくて、
Whoa, amazing! Not coyote, not a spirit—

254
00:31:23,280 --> 00:31:26,320
ヨウコ、ヨウコ、ヨウテ、コヨウテってこと？
Youko, Youko, Youte, Koyoute?

255
00:31:26,560 --> 00:31:29,880
そうそうそうそう！そうそうそうじゃないんだよ！
That's right, right! No it's not!

256
00:31:29,880 --> 00:31:31,980
じゃあコヨーテって何？
Then what's a coyote?

257
00:31:31,980 --> 00:31:35,440
コヨーテは、コヨーテや！
A coyote is a coyote!

258
00:31:35,640 --> 00:31:40,160
狼、キツネ、コヨーテみたいな感じなんだね！種類がありますね。
So it's like a wolf, fox, or coyote! There are different types.

259
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:44,300
今日だけはね、今日はこれを覚えて帰っていただければと思っております！
Today only, I hope you'll remember this and take it home with you!

260
00:31:44,300 --> 00:31:45,020
わかった！
Got it!

261
00:31:45,020 --> 00:31:46,500
よかったー！
Yay!

262
00:31:46,660 --> 00:31:50,600
はい、ということでですね、えー、そんなPちゃんと、はい。
Right, so, um, with P-chan here—

263
00:31:50,820 --> 00:31:55,820
えー、前にコラボした時に、一緒に歌いたいねって言ってた歌があるんですよね！
Um, when we collaborated before, there was a song we said we wanted to sing together!

264
00:31:55,980 --> 00:31:59,380
そう！はい！
That's right! Yes!

265
00:31:59,380 --> 00:32:05,200
はい、そのね、曲を、この後もう1曲一緒に歌っちゃいたいと思います！
Right, we'd love to sing one more song together right after this!

266
00:32:05,200 --> 00:32:14,420
イェーイ！じゃあちょっとあの、これ行っちゃうんで、万歳、万歳してくだ……万歳！万歳！
Yay! So let's do this—raise your hands, put your hands up... Banzai! Banzai!

267
00:32:14,420 --> 00:32:17,420
いやいや、それはキツネやろ！
No no, that's for a fox!

268
00:32:17,420 --> 00:32:23,060
えー、すごーい！ちょっとね、白衣っぽい上着を脱ぎまして、
Whoa, amazing! So I took off my lab coat-like jacket,

269
00:32:23,060 --> 00:32:28,200
次に歌うのは、同じなの、星見カンガルーダンスなのね！
and the next song we're singing is also... wait, Nanakorobi Kangaroo Dance!

270
00:32:28,200 --> 00:32:33,360
違う！一緒に歌いましょう！
No! Let's sing together!

271
00:32:33,360 --> 00:32:41,440
歌おう！歌おう！それでは聞いてください。せーの、乙女よ求めよQ.E.D.！
Let's sing! Let's sing! Please listen. Ready, go: 'Otome yo Motome yo Q.E.D.'!

272
00:32:53,732 --> 00:32:57,112
乙女よ求めよ Q.E.D!
Maidens, seek it out, Q.E.D!

273
00:32:57,112 --> 00:33:00,672
作詩：ナナホシ管弦楽団 作曲：岩見陸 編曲：ナナホシ管弦楽団
Lyrics: Nanahoshi Orchestra / Music: Riku Iwami / Arrangement: Nanahoshi Orchestra

274
00:33:06,992 --> 00:33:09,172
(Question!) 知りたいな
(Question!) I want to know

275
00:33:09,172 --> 00:33:12,352
君はさ 僕のことどう思う？
What do you think of me, huh?

276
00:33:12,352 --> 00:33:16,172
(Question!) 僕はね 君のこと あとは宿題！
(Question!) As for me, as for you... the rest is homework!

277
00:33:16,792 --> 00:33:22,232
ラブ・ラボ 引きこもっちゃうな？ 聞かなきゃって ほら相性！（実験中）
Love lab, locking ourselves away? We gotta ask—look, our chemistry! (Experiment in progress)

278
00:33:22,232 --> 00:33:27,052
論より証拠主義です 前進あるのみ！
Facts over theory, full speed ahead!

279
00:33:27,252 --> 00:33:30,272
ねえ 少し手伝って
Hey, lend a hand

280
00:33:30,272 --> 00:33:32,452
人類の課題
To humanity's challenge

281
00:33:32,452 --> 00:33:35,392
好き 好き 好き 好き 好き 好き 好き？
Like, like, like, like, like, like, like?

282
00:33:35,392 --> 00:33:37,412
答え合わせ しましょ？
Shall we check our answers?

283
00:33:37,412 --> 00:33:40,432
見つけちゃう！魔法の公式
We'll find it! The magic formula

284
00:33:40,432 --> 00:33:43,192
化学反応してるよね 僕ら
We're having a chemical reaction, aren't we?

285
00:33:43,192 --> 00:33:47,712
問題はまだまだまだまだ未解決（ドヤ！）
The problems are still, still, still unsolved (Nailed it!)

286
00:33:47,712 --> 00:33:50,092
証明中 恋の予想
Proving it now: the prediction of love

287
00:33:50,092 --> 00:33:54,032
物理法則 書き足しちゃうもんね
We'll just add to the laws of physics!

288
00:33:54,032 --> 00:33:55,812
（どうだ！）これぞ天才だ！
(How's that!) Now this is genius!

289
00:33:55,812 --> 00:34:00,672
あの子より その子より もっと（好きって）言ってちょうだい
Say you love me more than that girl, more than anyone else!

290
00:34:00,672 --> 00:34:05,792
乙女よ求めよ Q.E.D!
Maidens, seek it out, Q.E.D!

291
00:34:06,992 --> 00:34:11,772
(Question!) やっぱりさ さっきから僕のこと 見てたよね？
(Question!) Come to think of it, you've been watching me since earlier, haven't you?

292
00:34:12,232 --> 00:34:16,872
(Question!) 見てない？じゃあ 僕が 君のこと
(Question!) Not watching? Then... as for me, you...

293
00:34:17,432 --> 00:34:20,152
どぎまぎパラドックス
Flustered paradox

294
00:34:20,152 --> 00:34:22,732
慌てちゃって隠れちゃう？（葛藤中）
Panicking and hiding away? (Internal conflict)

295
00:34:22,732 --> 00:34:25,812
宇宙も秘密主義じゃビッグバン！
If even the universe is secretive—Big Bang!

296
00:34:27,932 --> 00:34:30,392
ねえ 君とふたり
Hey, just the two of us

297
00:34:30,392 --> 00:34:32,712
人類の終わり
At the end of humanity

298
00:34:32,712 --> 00:34:35,932
好き 好き 好き 好き 好き 好き 好き ∞未来でしょ？
Like, like, like, like, like, like, like = Infinite future, right?

299
00:34:35,932 --> 00:34:39,032
解きましょう！ 魔法の公式
Let's solve it! The magic formula

300
00:34:39,032 --> 00:34:42,172
惹かれ合うたび 不思議な
Every time we're drawn together, a mysterious

301
00:34:42,172 --> 00:34:46,092
レポートは進行形 まだまだまだまだまだ未提出（ドヤ！）
Report is in progress, still, still, still unsubmitted (Nailed it!)

302
00:34:46,092 --> 00:34:49,572
設計中 DNA 君の細胞
Designing DNA, your cells

303
00:34:49,572 --> 00:34:53,692
書き換えちゃうもんね（そうだ！）ズバリ天才だ！
Rewriting them! (That's right!) Exactly, you're a genius!

304
00:34:55,792 --> 00:35:00,104
どの子より この子より ずっと（好きって）言ってるじゃん！
I've been saying I love you more than any other girl!

305
00:35:00,112 --> 00:35:01,192
乙女よ求めよ Q.E.D.!
Maidens, seek Q.E.D.!

306
00:35:01,412 --> 00:35:04,012
乙女よ急げよ Q.E.D.!
Maidens, hurry Q.E.D.!

307
00:35:04,112 --> 00:35:11,412
好き 好き 好き 好き 好き 好き 好き？ 答え合わせしましょう？
Like, like, like, like, like, like, like? Shall we check our answers?

308
00:35:17,172 --> 00:35:26,572
ねえ 僕らふたり 人類の終わりに 割り切れなかった 余りだったら
Hey, if the two of us are just the remainder that couldn't be divided at the end of humanity...

309
00:35:27,212 --> 00:35:31,812
ねえ 少し手伝って 人類の課題
Hey, help me a little with humanity's problem!

310
00:35:32,012 --> 00:35:36,612
好き 好き 好き 好き 好き 好き 好き？ 答え合わせしましょう？
Like, like, like, like, like, like, like? Shall we check our answers?

311
00:35:36,912 --> 00:35:41,872
見つけちゃう！ 魔法の公式 化学反応してるよね 僕ら
Discovering the magic formula! We're having a chemical reaction, right?

312
00:35:42,372 --> 00:35:46,872
問題はまだまだまだまだ未解決
The problem is still, still, still, still unsolved!

313
00:35:47,172 --> 00:35:54,472
証明中 恋の予想 物理法則書き足しちゃうもんね これぞ天才だ！
Proving our love's prediction, rewriting the laws of physics, this is true genius!

314
00:35:55,072 --> 00:36:00,072
あの子より その子より もっと好きって言ってちょうだい
Tell me you like me more than that girl or this girl!

315
00:36:00,172 --> 00:36:02,572
乙女よ求めよ Q.E.D.! 乙女よ急げよ Q.E.D.!
Maidens, seek Q.E.D.! Maidens, hurry Q.E.D.!

316
00:36:03,072 --> 00:36:11,372
(3.141592653589793238462643383279502884197169...)

317
00:36:11,572 --> 00:36:13,872
Q.E.D.!

318
00:36:24,156 --> 00:36:30,856
今以上最大級叶えましょう みんな楽しんでる? ここからは盛り上がっていくよ！
Let's make it bigger than ever! Is everyone having fun? From here on out, let's get hyped up!

319
00:36:33,856 --> 00:36:40,856
探究心メラメラ抑えられないのです 冷こよなので余裕です こよは頭脳です！
My inquiring mind burns with uncontainable curiosity! As calm Koyori, it's a breeze! Koyori is brains!

320
00:36:41,556 --> 00:36:46,856
またひとつ発見！ マヨネーズは飲み物です カモン Q and A!
Another discovery: mayonnaise is a drink! Come on! Q & A!

321
00:36:47,156 --> 00:36:56,856
あっちこっちほら巻き起こる ドラマに体当たり実験！ 感じてみなきゃはじまらない 研究！（ゴーゴー！）生成！（あんさー！）共有！（成果！）で are you ok?
Look, drama sparks everywhere with a hands-on experiment! You gotta feel it for it to begin. Research! (Go-go!) Generation! (Answer!) Sharing! (Results!) Are you ok?

322
00:37:02,856 --> 00:37:09,856
一緒にどんどん過ごしましょう あなたと経験していくタイム 全部の夢そろえて証明完了（Q.E.D.）したってね
Let's spend more and more time together, experiencing time with you, aligning all our dreams and completing the proof (Q.E.D.)!

323
00:37:13,156 --> 00:37:16,856
また次がある 泣いて 笑って わおーん（わおーん）
There's always a next time, crying and laughing, wao-n! (wao-n!)

324
00:37:17,056 --> 00:37:27,856
どんな日も永遠願いはスマイル その胸に芽生えて欲しいシアワセ 今以上最大叶えましょう！
Whatever the day, my eternal wish is a smile, the happiness I want to sprout in your chest. Let's make it the greatest ever!

325
00:37:42,856 --> 00:37:53,856
なんか過ぎる愛の方程式 達成って曖昧なくせに ダイス必要はない
Passing by too quickly, the equation of love, despite the vague achievement, no dice are needed.

326
00:37:54,856 --> 00:38:06,856
未経験的な性質だって 不安という加減 片足で立って 支えていてよ 僕の正体
An unexperienced nature, adjusting with anxiety, standing on one leg and supporting my true identity!

327
00:38:07,856 --> 00:38:17,556
アンバランスな 僕の証明
Unbalanced, my proof!

328
00:38:33,056 --> 00:38:44,856
初めて正義を 共にかざせば 思い通りの光が 真っ直ぐに 飛び出して行く
If we raise our first justice together, the light just as we wanted shoots straight out!

329
00:38:45,056 --> 00:38:59,856
羽ばたいた 忘れないでね この眩しさを 希望に満ちた輝きを 追いかけて ありえない景色に
Fluttering wings, don't forget this dazzling light! Chasing after the brilliance filled with hope, to an unbelievable scenery...

330
00:38:59,856 --> 00:39:02,556
たどり着きましょう
Let's reach it together!

331
00:39:08,056 --> 00:39:20,856
招待頂戴 一生楽しもうよシーソー 壊す程めいっぱい戯れて 居場所をしるした
Invitation requested! Let's enjoy the seesaw for a lifetime, playing as much as we can until it breaks, marking our place!

332
00:39:23,056 --> 00:39:30,856
素敵な日常なんでしょ 答えのないような最後まで 行き急ごう
It must be a wonderful everyday life, let's rush through life to the very end with no answers!

333
00:39:31,056 --> 00:39:44,856
やりたいことなして楽しい 手を振ってらしくいたいから 苦しいなんてやだわ すぐなり振り構わず
Doing what I want and having fun, waving my hands and wanting to be myself, I hate feeling painful, ignoring appearances right away!

334
00:39:45,056 --> 00:39:49,056
わがままな夢もっと謳歌しよう
Let's enjoy our selfish dream even more!

335
00:40:05,164 --> 00:40:09,564
そぅ キミの前で笑って見せる
Yes, I'll try smiling right in front of you...

336
00:40:09,864 --> 00:40:14,664
強がりなぼくだけど
Even though I'm just acting tough.

337
00:40:15,164 --> 00:40:20,164
毛布の中一人で涙流す日もある
There are days I shed tears all alone under the blanket,

338
00:40:20,564 --> 00:40:24,864
孤独の戦士だ
A warrior of solitude.

339
00:40:25,164 --> 00:40:29,864
自分に正直な 「やりたい」にまっすぐな
Honest with myself, straightforward about what I want to do,

340
00:40:30,164 --> 00:40:34,564
キミだけのヒーローでありたい
I want to be your one and only hero...

341
00:40:35,064 --> 00:40:39,864
悔しさを重ねて駆け上がっていこう
Let's stack up our frustrations and climb higher!

342
00:40:44,164 --> 00:40:46,864
今はまだ未知の途中
We're still right in the middle of the unknown.

343
00:40:53,964 --> 00:40:59,064
きっと
I'm sure...

344
00:41:02,864 --> 00:41:04,264
絶対諦めない
I will never give up!

345
00:41:23,264 --> 00:41:28,064
ああ 精いっぱい 目いっぱい
Ah, with all my might, with all my heart,

346
00:41:28,064 --> 00:41:32,864
まだまだまだ 明日を目指して
Still aiming for tomorrow, on and on,

347
00:41:32,864 --> 00:41:37,864
全力で Q.E.D. まだまだまだ 夢の向こうへ
Giving it our all, Q.E.D.! Further and further beyond our dreams!

348
00:41:37,864 --> 00:41:42,064
No way!! どんな難題でも 最適解で弾き返せ
No way!! No matter what difficult problem arises, we'll bounce it back with the optimal solution!

349
00:41:42,564 --> 00:41:47,864
へこたれたって最後まで前進
Even if we get discouraged, we'll push forward until the very end!

350
00:41:48,264 --> 00:41:53,064
3(Hi!) 2(Hi!) 1で Fly High!!
3 (Hi!), 2 (Hi!), 1 and Fly High!!

351
00:41:53,064 --> 00:41:57,064
どんな絶望までも僕たちは諦めないからさ
No matter what despair comes, we'll never give up.

352
00:41:58,064 --> 00:42:01,864
僕だけじゃない 君だけじゃない
It's not just me, it's not just you either!

353
00:42:18,564 --> 00:43:18,064
[Text: Now Loading...]

354
00:43:29,672 --> 00:43:33,792
悔しくて嫌いになった
I grew to resent it out of frustration...

355
00:43:34,272 --> 00:43:37,592
消えてしまいたいと思った
Thinking I just wanted to disappear.

356
00:43:38,102 --> 00:43:41,902
だから聞こえないように叫ぶ歌
So I scream out a song so it won't be heard,

357
00:43:41,902 --> 00:43:45,392
水たまりに吐き捨てた声
A voice spat out into a puddle.

358
00:43:51,172 --> 00:43:55,172
[Title: 水たまり]

359
00:43:55,172 --> 00:43:57,172
[Credits: 作詞・作曲 Carlos.K]
[Credits: Lyrics & Music by Carlos.K]

360
00:44:05,722 --> 00:44:09,602
この感情は何なのだろう
What is this emotion, I wonder?

361
00:44:10,022 --> 00:44:13,502
素直に受け入れられないよ
I just can't accept it honestly.

362
00:44:13,912 --> 00:44:18,082
息もできないほどに押し潰されてく
Being crushed to the point where I can't even breathe...

363
00:44:18,422 --> 00:44:22,162
あぁ 誰かの眩しさに焦って
Ah, growing impatient at someone else's brilliance,

364
00:44:22,252 --> 00:44:26,612
待ってなんて生きづらい なんで？
Wondering why it's so hard to live just waiting around, why?

365
00:44:26,772 --> 00:44:30,052
唇を噛み締めた
As I bit down hard on my lips.

366
00:44:31,002 --> 00:44:34,572
乾いた心に降る雨
Rain falls on a parched heart,

367
00:44:34,872 --> 00:44:36,672
思いがたまる
Feelings pile up,

368
00:44:37,002 --> 00:44:39,222
水面に映った
Reflected on the water's surface,

369
00:44:39,452 --> 00:44:41,122
この顔は嘘つきだ
This face is a liar.

370
00:44:41,502 --> 00:44:43,072
聞いて
Listen to me...

371
00:44:43,322 --> 00:44:50,622
綺麗じゃない 綺麗じゃないでも 嫌いじゃない 嫌いじゃないでしょ まっすぐに不器用でもいい
It's not pretty, it's not pretty, but it's not that I hate it, is it? Even if it's straight-on and clumsy, that's fine.

372
00:44:50,922 --> 00:44:59,072
どうでもいい どうでもいいんだよ 君を襲うどんな雨も 水たまり踏みつけて
It doesn't matter, it doesn't matter at all. Stomp on any rain that attacks you, right in the puddle.

373
00:45:00,472 --> 00:45:06,572
笑われたっていいんだ 溢れたっていいんだから
It's okay to be laughed at, it's okay if it overflows...

374
00:45:07,272 --> 00:45:16,572
恐れずに前を向いたら 息をしてみて
If you face forward without fear, try taking a breath...

375
00:45:24,072 --> 00:45:31,572
誰かの物語に生きて 自分が主役じゃないなんて 分かってる いい子演じればそれでいい
Living in someone else's story, knowing you aren't the protagonist... If playing the good girl is enough, there's no way that's fine.

376
00:45:32,272 --> 00:45:39,572
訳ないよな本音は大嫌い そんな自分が大嫌いだ 許せないここままじゃ
My true feelings are I hate myself, I hate that kind of myself, I can't forgive staying like this.

377
00:45:40,272 --> 00:45:47,572
砂漠に降り続ける雨 傘もささずに
Rain falling continuously on the desert, without even opening an umbrella...

378
00:45:48,272 --> 00:45:56,572
隠した涙は 誰にも分からないでしょ
The tears I hid, nobody will ever understand them, right?

379
00:45:58,572 --> 00:46:07,872
聞いて くだらない くだらない このあらすじは破り捨てたい 書きかえる 運命を
Listen... this absurd, worthless synopsis, I want to tear it up and rewrite fate.

380
00:46:08,572 --> 00:46:16,872
空っぽなその笑顔に さよならと伝えたんだ もうここには戻らない
Saying goodbye to that empty smile, I'm not coming back here anymore.

381
00:46:17,272 --> 00:46:28,072
綺麗じゃない 綺麗じゃないでも 嫌いじゃない 嫌いじゃないでしょ まっすぐに不器用でもいい
Not pretty at all, but I don't hate it either. Is it okay to be clumsy and straightforward?

382
00:46:29,272 --> 00:46:36,572
君を襲うどんな雨も 水たまり踏みつけて
Trampling through any rain that attacks you, stepping right through the puddles...

383
00:46:37,072 --> 00:46:44,572
笑われたっていいんだ 溢れたっていいんだから
It's okay to be laughed at, it's okay if it overflows...

384
00:46:45,072 --> 00:46:52,572
恐れずに前を向いたら 息をしてみて
If you face forward without fear, try taking a breath...

385
00:46:58,072 --> 00:47:06,572
ラララ...
La-la-la...

386
00:47:19,472 --> 00:47:26,572
はい！というわけで、こよ！歌えたー！ちょっと緊張したかも。
Yes! So, Koyo! We sang it! I might have been a little nervous.

387
00:47:27,072 --> 00:47:30,572
めっちゃ緊張したこよもお誕生日おめでとう
I was super nervous too! Koyomo, happy birthday!

388
00:47:31,072 --> 00:47:35,572
ありがとう！
Thank you!

389
00:47:38,572 --> 00:47:44,572
と言うことで今回は生演奏でお聞かせいただいたんですけども
So this time, we got to perform with live musical accompaniment,

390
00:47:45,072 --> 00:47:50,072
こよりはねみお先輩のしっとりした歌声が大好きなので一緒に歌いたいなと思ってお呼びしちゃいました
and Koyori loves Mio-senpai's emotional singing voice so much, so I really wanted to sing together and invited her!

391
00:47:50,072 --> 00:47:54,572
ありがとう！こよのね可愛い声もさ、なんかいろんなかっこいい歌声もあったりしてさっきも聞いてたんだけど
Thank you! And Koyo's cute voice, and having various cool singing voices—I was listening earlier too,

392
00:47:55,072 --> 00:48:03,072
うれしかっためっちゃ上手だったよな
and I was so happy! You were so good at singing!

393
00:48:04,072 --> 00:48:07,572
みお先輩に褒めてもらえると嬉しくて泣いちゃう
When Mio-senpai praises me, I get so happy I could cry!

394
00:48:08,072 --> 00:48:13,572
そしてですね素敵な演奏はウイングさんにしていただいております
And furthermore, the wonderful accompaniment is provided by Wing-san!

395
00:48:19,072 --> 00:48:23,072
素敵すぎ...すごいに染み渡ります
So wonderful... It really soaks into the heart!

396
00:48:24,072 --> 00:48:26,572
ありがとうございました
Thank you very much!

397
00:48:26,572 --> 00:48:30,072
はいという事で二人で歌うのはあのフェスのANIMALとか
Yes, so, singing together—like for the Fes's ANIMAL and...

398
00:48:30,572 --> 00:48:35,072
あとみお先輩の4周年の夜もすがら君を思う
and also Mio-senpai's 4th anniversary song "Yomosugara Kimi o Omou,"

399
00:48:35,072 --> 00:48:42,072
歌えたねいらいですねこうやってしっとりガチしっとりは初めてかもね
we sang that, right? It's been since then. Doing a proper emotional song like this might be our first time!

400
00:48:42,072 --> 00:48:47,072
いやあ楽しかったですありがとうございます
Yeah, it was so fun! Thank you very much!

401
00:48:47,572 --> 00:48:54,072
いやちょっとねでもなかなかこういう機会をねあの生演奏でっていうのはなかなかいただけないからちょっと嬉しかったでも
Yeah, you know, but we rarely get such an opportunity to perform with live accompaniment, so I was really happy, though.

402
00:48:54,072 --> 00:48:59,072
呼んでくれてありがとう今日めちゃくちゃあの長時間待たせてるんで
Thanks for inviting me! Today you've been waiting for—um, for quite a long time,

403
00:48:59,072 --> 00:49:03,072
演奏終えて嬉しい本当に忙しい中ありがとう
I'm so glad we finished the performance! Thank you so much despite your busy schedule!

404
00:49:03,572 --> 00:49:06,072
こよの誕生日お祝いできてよかったよ
I'm so glad I could celebrate Koyo's birthday!

405
00:49:06,072 --> 00:49:10,072
よかったそして無事に歌えてよかった
I'm glad! And I'm glad we could sing safely!

406
00:49:10,572 --> 00:49:15,572
体調もねよく整えてきたね今日ね
You really took good care of your health for today, huh!

407
00:49:15,572 --> 00:49:20,072
本当今日やっと歌えるようになって本当によかった声も出るようになっててすごいなって
Really, I'm so glad you could finally sing today! Your voice came back and that's amazing!

408
00:49:20,072 --> 00:49:23,072
よかったよ一緒歌えてよかった無事
I'm so glad! I'm glad we could sing together safely!

409
00:49:24,072 --> 00:49:26,572
じゃあまあねこの後ももうちょっと続くみたいだから
Well, it seems like it's going to continue a bit more after this,

410
00:49:27,072 --> 00:49:31,072
うちもねここらでちょっとお暇しようかなって思います
so I think I'll take my leave around here!

411
00:49:31,072 --> 00:49:36,072
ありがとうございますじゃあがんばってねみんなも出るから
Thank you very much! Well, do your best! Everyone is watching too!

412
00:49:36,572 --> 00:49:41,072
じゃあねありがとう助手くんたちもありがとね
Bye-bye! Thank you! Thank you to all the Joshi-kun as well!

413
00:49:41,572 --> 00:49:48,572
えっさ、ほいっさ。えほえほではないんだちょっとだけ水をね
Essa, hoissa! Wait, it's not 'hoe-hoe'? Just a little water...

414
00:49:49,072 --> 00:50:00,072
よしお茶飲ませていただきまして生演奏パートもう1曲歌わせていただきたいと思っています次の曲は2回目の作詞に挑戦して
Alright, after having some tea, we'd like to sing one more song in the live accompaniment part! The next song is my second attempt at lyric writing...

415
00:50:00,200 --> 00:50:05,230
思いを込めた曲です！ファーストアルバムから聞いてください。
This song is filled with my feelings! Please listen to it from my first album.

416
00:50:05,730 --> 00:50:07,230
Dear you...

417
00:50:13,990 --> 00:50:16,930
ねぇもしも ねぇもしも
Hey, what if... Hey, what if...

418
00:50:31,100 --> 00:50:41,900
くらくて孤独に飲まれそうな夜
On a dark night when I'm about to be swallowed by loneliness,

419
00:50:44,030 --> 00:50:54,930
ソファで独り膝抱え ちっぽけさ感じてた
hugging my knees alone on the sofa, feeling so small.

420
00:50:56,960 --> 00:51:03,060
強いよね 見られがち ほんとは弱いのに
People often see me as strong, even though I'm actually weak.

421
00:51:04,130 --> 00:51:09,630
不器用で負けず嫌い 甘えられないから
Clumsy and competitive, unable to rely on others,

422
00:51:09,930 --> 00:51:16,330
誰にも言えないままのぼくの弱さに
to my weakness that I could never tell anyone about,

423
00:51:17,000 --> 00:51:24,500
キミだけが手を差し伸べてくれたんだ
you were the only one who reached out a hand.

424
00:51:26,600 --> 00:51:32,500
一緒に笑って 一緒に悔しんで
Laughing together, feeling frustrated together,

425
00:51:33,130 --> 00:51:40,530
そんな日々が かけがえない宝物
those days are my irreplaceable treasure.

426
00:51:41,130 --> 00:51:47,430
一生こんな日が続いていくように
Wishing that days like this would last a lifetime,

427
00:51:47,730 --> 00:51:53,530
ぼくにできることは何だってしたいよ
I want to do whatever I can for you.

428
00:51:54,330 --> 00:52:06,030
ねぇもしも ねぇもしも キミがぼくを忘れちゃっても
Hey, what if... Hey, what if you even forgot about me,

429
00:52:07,130 --> 00:52:21,130
キミの中にぼくの生きざまが かすかでも残って
I hope even a trace of how I lived remains inside you.

430
00:52:34,330 --> 00:52:46,130
キミがね いるから 強くなれるよ
Because you're here, I can be strong.

431
00:52:47,930 --> 00:52:58,330
不安も辛さも一緒なら 乗り越えられるんだ
If we're together through anxiety and pain, we can overcome it.

432
00:53:00,030 --> 00:53:12,130
一緒に泣いて 一緒に前を見て キミといると嫌いなとこも愛せる
Crying together, looking forward together, when I'm with you, I can even love the things I hate.

433
00:53:13,530 --> 00:53:26,330
一生一緒だよ なんて言っても 叶うかなんて誰にも分からない でも
Even if someone says 'we'll be together forever,' no one knows if it will come true, but

434
00:53:27,530 --> 00:53:37,330
ねぇキミに ねぇずっと 好きでいてほしい ワガママかな
Hey, I want you to keep loving me forever... is that too selfish of a wish?

435
00:53:40,030 --> 00:53:47,530
すべて 夢を 叶える日まで
Until the day all our dreams come true.

436
00:53:49,530 --> 00:54:02,430
一緒に笑って 一緒に前を見て ずっとキミの隣にいられますように
Laughing together, looking forward together, hoping I can always be by your side.

437
00:54:03,230 --> 00:54:16,030
キミが好きで いてくれるのなら ぼくはここにいるよ
If you continue to love me, I will be right here.

438
00:54:19,830 --> 00:54:29,230
ねぇこれも 夢だよ ねぇすべて 叶うかな
Hey, is this also a dream? Hey, will all of them come true?

439
00:54:29,930 --> 00:54:34,130
ねぇキミに ありがとう
Hey, thank you so much.

440
00:54:51,230 --> 00:55:00,080
Parade, parade, parade! 輝くんだよ 呼び合う声を合図に
Parade, parade, parade! Shining bright, signaling with our calling voices...

441
00:55:00,176 --> 00:55:03,238
君と在ることなんだ
It's being with you...

442
00:55:05,188 --> 00:55:08,588
Parade, parade, parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, parade, parade! Shines bright!

443
00:55:11,288 --> 00:55:17,088
スタートは何度だって
No matter how many times we start over,

444
00:55:39,088 --> 00:55:42,588
ただ独り言を綴った
I simply penned a soliloquy...

445
00:55:43,588 --> 00:55:47,588
ただ始まりたくて走った
I just ran because I wanted to begin.

446
00:55:48,588 --> 00:55:52,588
遠く暗がりに灯った
Lit up far away in the gloom,

447
00:55:54,088 --> 00:55:57,588
それは眩し過ぎた名前
that was a name that shone too brightly.

448
00:55:59,088 --> 00:56:02,088
それは優し過ぎる思い出
That was a memory too gentle,

449
00:56:03,088 --> 00:56:09,088
もっと近づけと手を伸ばした 思いがけず結び合った
I reached out to get closer, and unexpectedly we were tied together.

450
00:56:09,588 --> 00:56:13,588
ほら 今 迷子は「僕等」になった
Look, now the lost ones have become "us".

451
00:56:14,588 --> 00:56:23,588
Parade, parade, parade! 輝くんだよ 悔しさも愛しさも連れておいで
Parade, parade, parade! Shining bright, bring your frustration and affection along, come on!

452
00:56:24,088 --> 00:56:29,088
風 夢 羽 飛び立てるさ
Wind, dreams, feathers, we can take flight!

453
00:56:30,088 --> 00:56:39,088
ささやかな祈りは光 終わりなき兆し 君を見つけたこと 胸を張れるよ
A modest prayer is a light, an endless sign. I can hold my head high for finding you.

454
00:56:40,088 --> 00:56:44,588
ここから これから Our bright parade, parade!
From here, from now on, Our bright parade, parade!

455
00:56:55,088 --> 00:56:59,088
まだ 頼りない予感を
Still holding uncertain premonitions,

456
00:57:00,088 --> 00:57:04,588
歌おう 恥ずかしくなんてないよ
Let's sing, there's nothing to be embarrassed about!

457
00:57:05,088 --> 00:57:09,588
誰も解けないイマジナリー
An imaginary that nobody can untangle,

458
00:57:10,088 --> 00:57:14,588
いつかまた逢える おまじない
A spell so we can meet again someday.

459
00:57:15,588 --> 00:57:19,588
あの日 ゼロに始まったストーリー
A story that started from zero on that day,

460
00:57:20,588 --> 00:57:25,588
数え切れない言の葉 数えるような 想いじゃないさ
It's not feelings like counting countless leaves of words.

461
00:57:26,088 --> 00:57:30,088
ほら 今「僕等」を一つと呼ぼう
Look, now let's call "us" one!

462
00:57:31,088 --> 00:57:40,088
Parade, parade, parade! 美しいんだよ 許し合える刹那 夜はきらめく
Parade, parade, parade! It's beautiful, the moment we can forgive each other, the night sparkles.

463
00:57:41,088 --> 00:57:50,088
雨 晴れ カレイド またとない空 相応しい旅路とは 君と在ることさ
Rain, shine, kaleidoscope, a once-in-a-lifetime sky. A fitting journey is being with you.

464
00:57:54,088 --> 00:57:59,588
君と在ることなんだ
It is being with you.

465
00:57:59,888 --> 00:58:06,088
「ただいま」を聞けば「おかえり」って叫ぶよ
When I hear "I'm home", I'll shout "Welcome back!"

466
00:58:07,588 --> 00:58:12,088
当たり前じゃないか
Isn't that obvious?

467
00:58:13,088 --> 00:58:22,088
Parade, parade, parade! 輝くんだよ 暗がりを満たすのは 君だ 僕だ！
Parade, parade, parade! Shining bright, what fills the gloom is you, is me!

468
00:58:24,588 --> 00:58:33,088
Parade, parade, parade! 輝くんだよ 悔しさも愛しさも連れておいで
Parade, parade, parade! Shining bright, bring your frustration and affection along, come on!

469
00:58:34,588 --> 00:58:44,088
風 夢 羽 飛び立てるさ ささやかな祈りは光 終わりなき兆し 君と飛び込んでゆく
Wind, dreams, feathers, we can take flight! A modest prayer is an endless sign, plunging in with you.

470
00:58:49,588 --> 00:58:54,588
ここから これから Our bright parade, parade!
From here, from now on, Our bright parade, parade!

471
00:58:58,088 --> 00:59:09,088
Our bright parade, parade!

472
00:59:17,588 --> 00:59:19,588
告知パート！
Announcement part!

473
00:59:19,588 --> 00:59:25,588
あの、この告知の後にもまだ歌うので、チャンネルはそのままで最後まで見てってくださーい！
Um, there's still more singing after this announcement, so please keep your channel tuned and watch until the very end!

474
00:59:26,088 --> 00:59:35,088
そして、トレンド入りもありがとう！なんだかご縁のありそうな方のホームランが凄いです、おめでとうございます！
Also, thank you for trending! Someone who seems to have a lucky connection hit an amazing home run, congratulations!

475
00:59:35,588 --> 00:59:46,088
トレンドもありがとうね！そしてですね、この告知パート、最後のほうにこよの配信でいいのか？というすごい告知もありますので、最後まで見てってくださーい！
Thanks for the trending too! And also, towards the end of this announcement part, there's an incredible announcement like "Is this really okay for Koyori's stream?", so please watch until the very end!

476
00:59:46,588 --> 00:59:59,088
ではまず1つ目は、冒頭でも言っていたこちら！博衣こより 1st アルバム『FIRST STEP』、ダウンロード版は0時から販売開始されております、概要欄からすでに飛べますのでゲットしてください！
Now, first up is what I mentioned right at the start! Hakui Koyori's 1st album "FIRST STEP". The digital version is already available for purchase starting at midnight, and you can jump right to it from the description box, so please grab your copy!

477
01:00:00,222 --> 01:00:08,622
まずね、限定ボーナストラック…はい！はい！はい！はい！こんこよのOPが入っているCD盤もこのあと21時からECサイトで受注販売もう一度行われますよ。
First, the limited bonus track... Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes! The CD featuring the Konkoyo OP will be available for pre-order again on the EC store starting at 9 PM tonight.

478
01:00:11,302 --> 01:00:16,222
歌詞カードもね入ってるんでこれじっくり読むのがすごい楽しいってみんなにご好評でした。
The lyric card is included too, and everyone told me how much fun it is to read through it carefully.

479
01:00:16,702 --> 01:00:23,742
そして、通常版封入特典といたしまして、メインジャケットの表情違いのアナザージャケットカードがついてきます！
And as a regular edition enclosure bonus, you'll get another jacket card with a different facial expression from the main jacket!

480
01:00:24,182 --> 01:00:32,502
